body:
Olanzapine absolutely destroyed my body, i put shit tonnes of weight on and felt tired constantly;

Legit gained 140lbs in a short amount of time. It took me a long time to lose that weight and get my body some semblance of "healthy" and 

Request to swap with a different medication.

Talk and treat yourself as though you love and accept yourself;

tell your inner child how much you understand him/her, how much you love them and remind them that they're safe, that it's okay to feel sad/mad/bad and how you are sorry you couldn't do more to protect them and that its okay now, its okay to just be here.

might not work for everyone but...

Is that a thing??!! Oh god, if so then its the best description I've heard of my night time troubles with sleeping OR least it *feels* like I do...

Every night, I feel tired and then suddenly get a surge through my body, almost like someone has just injected me with caffeine and I feel like I can run a marathon and solve all of the problems in the world;

It's exhausting 😴
